{
 "id": "vesa-adapter-plate-petg",
 "brief": "A VESA adapter plate in PETG (FDM, printed flat, layers along Z): a 6 mm plate (z = 0 to 6) within x, y = -60 to 60 that lets a monitor with a 75 mm hole pattern hang on an arm with a 100 mm pattern. Four M4 screws at (+-37.5, +-37.5) go through the plate from the arm side (heads at z = 0) into the monitor's threads; the monitor sits against z = 6. Four M4 screws at (+-50, +-50), heads counterbored 3 mm deep from the monitor side, go into the arm plate, which sits against z = 0. The monitor is 5 kg with its centre of mass 40 mm in front of the plate (z = 46); gravity is -Y; allow a factor of 2 for knocks. Safety factor 3.",
